<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτελ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pay</i> or <i>expend beforehand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἡμῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.7.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ages.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ οὗ ἂν π. εἰς τὴν ἀφορμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					3.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρὸς τὰς θυσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Philops.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			: <i>lend</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				255
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				279.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>initiate</i> or <i>instruct beforehand</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				14
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ὥσπερ ἐν ἱεροῖς -τελεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.97
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>accomplish before</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσίν τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -τετελεσμένα ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
